            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/467370/extras/8eee270c063aadf8fe042814e72f4895.avif?t=1782125571\" width=400 height=100 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape This</strong></h2> is a casual puzzle game where the main objective is for the player to complete the given stage. <br>Each stage is selected at random.<br><br>All maps can be edited and you are also able to create your own unique maps and share them with the rest of the community.<br><br><strong>Can you escape?</strong>",
